      "sample_index": 0,
      "text": "Substitute the points $(4,5)$ and $(8,17)$ into the equation $y = ax + b$ to get a system of equations:\n\\[5 = 4a + b \\quad \\text{(1)}\\]\n\\[17 = 8a + b \\quad \\text{(2)}\\]\nSubtract equation (1) from equation (2) to eliminate $b$:\n\\[17 - 5 = 8a + b - (4a + b)\\]\n\\[12 = 4a\\]\n\\[a = 3\\]\nSubstitute $a = 3$ into equation (1) to solve for $b$:\n\\[5 = 4(3) + b\\]\n\\[5 = 12 + b\\]\n\\[b = -7\\]\nSo, $a - b = 3 - (-7) = 3 + 7 = \\boxed{10}$. The answer is: 10",
